@inject Diten.Web.Services.IPermissionSnapshot Perms
@*
    MOD-0175 pack §14 "Screen → button → action → permission": action code → may this user see it. The page scripts ask
    QuarantineUi.can('DECIDE') — they never name a permission key, so a button cannot drift from its key. Display only:
    InventoryService's [HasPermission] stays the authority (UAS-001 §4); a button without its key is absent, not disabled.
*@
<script id="quarantine-actions" type="application/json">@Json.Serialize(Diten.Web.Controllers.QuarantineKeys.For(Perms))</script>
